(# BuffaloSpeed MT5 Client Handover Guide) Tj
0 -15 Td
() Tj
0 -15 Td
(## 1\) What BuffaloSpeed does) Tj
0 -15 Td
(BuffaloSpeed is an automated MetaTrader 5 \(MT5\) Expert Advisor \(EA\) that:) Tj
0 -15 Td
(- scans multiple symbols from a configured symbol list,) Tj
0 -15 Td
(- generates trade signals using EMA crossover logic,) Tj
0 -15 Td
(- calculates lot size from account risk settings,) Tj
0 -15 Td
(- opens trades with SL/TP checks against broker stop rules,) Tj
0 -15 Td
(- manages open positions using break-even and trailing stop,) Tj
0 -15 Td
(- blocks new trades if drawdown/daily loss limits are breached,) Tj
0 -15 Td
(- displays a live dashboard on chart,) Tj
0 -15 Td
(- validates license key before trading.) Tj
0 -15 Td
() Tj
0 -15 Td
(## 2\) Installation \(MT5\)) Tj
0 -15 Td
(1. Open MT5 -> File -> Open Data Folder.) Tj
0 -15 Td
(2. Go to `MQL5/Experts/`.) Tj
0 -15 Td
(3. Copy these files into that folder:) Tj
0 -15 Td
(   - BuffaloSpeed.mq5) Tj
0 -15 Td
(   - BuffaloLogger.mqh) Tj
0 -15 Td
(   - BuffaloDashboard.mqh) Tj
0 -15 Td
(   - BuffaloSymbolManager.mqh) Tj
0 -15 Td
(   - BuffaloSignalEngine.mqh) Tj
0 -15 Td
(   - BuffaloMoneyManager.mqh) Tj
0 -15 Td
(   - BuffaloTradeManager.mqh) Tj
0 -15 Td
(   - BuffaloRiskManager.mqh) Tj
0 -15 Td
(4. Restart MT5 \(or refresh Navigator\).) Tj
0 -15 Td
(5. Open `BuffaloSpeed.mq5` in MetaEditor and compile.) Tj
0 -15 Td
() Tj
0 -15 Td
(## 3\) Setup before running) Tj
0 -15 Td
(- Attach BuffaloSpeed to one chart.) Tj
0 -15 Td
(- Enable Algo Trading in MT5.) Tj
0 -15 Td
(- Set inputs:) Tj
0 -15 Td
(  - License: `InpLicenseKey`) Tj
0 -15 Td
(  - Symbols: `InpSymbols` \(comma-separated, e.g. EURUSD,GBPUSD,USDJPY\)) Tj
0 -15 Td
(  - Signal: timeframe + MA periods) Tj
0 -15 Td
(  - Risk: per-trade %, max daily loss %, max drawdown %) Tj
0 -15 Td
(  - Protection: stop loss, take profit, break-even, trailing stop) Tj
0 -15 Td
(  - Execution: magic number, slippage) Tj
0 -15 Td
() Tj
0 -15 Td
(## 4\) How execution works) Tj
0 -15 Td
(1. On init: license + symbol validation + module setup.) Tj
0 -15 Td
(2. Every timer cycle:) Tj
0 -15 Td
(   - risk check runs,) Tj
0 -15 Td
(   - each configured symbol is processed,) Tj
0 -15 Td
(   - duplicate same-candle entries are prevented,) Tj
0 -15 Td
(   - signal is evaluated,) Tj
0 -15 Td
(   - lot size is calculated,) Tj
0 -15 Td
(   - order is sent only if broker stop-distance constraints are valid.) Tj
ET
